flowchart TD
    CODE["app code logs structured events"] --> LOGGER["Logger (central abstraction)"]
    LOGGER --> REDACT["redaction: typed Sensitive + pattern backstop"]
    REDACT --> LEVEL{"level + build"}
    LEVEL -->|debug build| LOGCAT["Logcat sink (verbose)"]
    LEVEL -->|release warn/error| CRASH["crash reporter (scrubbed)"]
    LEVEL -->|allowed analytics| ANALYTICS["analytics (schema-validated, no PII)"]
    CONSENT["user consent / privacy"] -.-> ANALYTICS
    CID["correlation IDs (Ch 1/84)"] -.-> LOGGER
    RAW["raw Log/println"] -.->|forbidden - lint| LOGGER
